2026-07-01 03:32:16,702 [INFO]     FUT-VWAP cross-count >= CHOP_VWAP_CROSSES_MIN (3) OR first-hour range <
2026-07-01 03:32:16,702 [INFO]     CHOP_RANGE_PT_MAX (110pt)). Exits always allowed. Fails OPEN (not enough
2026-07-01 03:32:16,703 [INFO]     bars yet -> no decision -> trade normally). morning_chop_verdict().
2026-07-01 03:32:16,703 [INFO]   + #2 VWAP BODY BAND (VWAP_BODY_CLIMAX_PCT): VWAP entry now takes only the
